{"id":"n29764-3-10","stage":3,"title":"막다 · 阻挡","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29764-3-10-1","ko":"이 박스로 뭘 하려고?","zh":"你想用这个盒子做什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"박스로","meaning":"盒子，箱子","explanation":"박스：盒子，箱子；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"박스","audio":"/audio/f5d00f1dac712a649844.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57330","senseId":"1","lemma":"박스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"박스로","audio":"/audio/3f0f49d39c60f063bc7d.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"하려고?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；려고：非敬语地表达打算，或根据语调询问意图。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하려고","audio":"/audio/761078da9d37d7327667.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"f5d00f1dac712a64","term":"박스","zh":"盒子，箱子","audio":"/audio/f5d00f1dac712a649844.mp3","entryId":"57330","definition":"可以装东西的，用木头或纸等制作的方形器皿。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d89547898264a3c1e16e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29764-3-10-2","ko":"머리에 쓰면 눈을 막을 수 있을 것 같아서.","zh":"我觉得把它戴在头上应该能遮住眼睛。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"머리에","meaning":"头","explanation":"머리：头；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"1","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머리에","audio":"/audio/706e62328b1459269ae9.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰면","meaning":"戴","explanation":"쓰다：戴；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65173","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰면","audio":"/audio/cacd9de3fdf20ad11c61.mp3"}},{"text":"눈을","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"눈：眼睛；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈을","audio":"/audio/5b944ed45a5a960e9d96.mp3"}},{"text":"막을","meaning":"阻挡，遮挡","explanation":"막다：阻挡，遮挡；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"막다","audio":"/audio/53d2fc1b7a9fe8032372.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29764","senseId":"3","lemma":"막다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"막을","audio":"/audio/17f8be30ca2b3d9dce58.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있을","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을","audio":"/audio/e77f5d4b360ff618b52e.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아서.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아서","audio":"/audio/a38b450f1fcf31c027d2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"在人或动物身体中，包括脸和头发的脖子以上的部分。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"戴","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65173","definition":"将帽子或假发等套在头上。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"眼睛","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"人或动物的一种感觉器官，位于脸部，受光线刺激后能看到物体。","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"53d2fc1b7a9fe803","term":"막다","zh":"阻挡，遮挡","audio":"/audio/53d2fc1b7a9fe8032372.mp3","entryId":"29764","definition":"使某物不能进入里面。","pronunciation":["막따"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"